WEBVTT

00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:31.736
And putting buckets
in the living room to catch the rain

00:00:31.736 --> 00:00:35.406
in a futile attempt
to stop our house from flooding

00:00:35.448 --> 00:00:38.242
when the roof started to billow
and sag in the wind.

00:00:39.535 --> 00:00:40.912
I hated it.

00:00:41.245 --> 00:00:44.874
Because I was terrified the entire time,

00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:47.418
whether it was a tropical wave,

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:50.379
a thunderstorm, a tropical storm

00:00:50.379 --> 00:00:54.550
or the tail-end of an actual hurricane
that barely missed us.

00:00:54.592 --> 00:00:56.260
It was all the same to me.

00:00:56.719 --> 00:00:58.137
A possible end.

00:00:58.721 --> 00:01:02.809
No light, no water, no electricity,